msgid "marked as the wide shot -- it takes no speakers"
msgstr "označena kao široki kadar -- ne prima govornike"

msgid "no speaker is assigned to it, but the cut uses %s"
msgstr "nije joj dodijeljen nijedan govornik, ali rez koristi %s"

msgid "the cut uses %s"
msgstr "rez koristi %s"

msgid "Curve and colour space are missing from the file"
msgstr "U datoteci nedostaju krivulja i prostor boja"

msgid "In point and Out point are available once the time axis is set -- from the timecode or measured."
msgstr "Tačka In i tačka Out dostupne su čim je postavljena vremenska osa -- iz vremenskog koda ili izmjerena."

msgid "In point is %s before the first frame"
msgstr "Tačka In je %s prije prve sličice"

msgid "In point is now %s, but the existing files belong to %s.\n  The audio in the videos is cut to the old window -- press Start\n  above again."
msgstr "Tačka In sada je %s, ali postojeće datoteke pripadaju %s.\n  Zvuk u videima izrezan je na stari prozor -- pritisnite gore\n  ponovo Pokreni."

msgid "Out point is %s after the last frame"
msgstr "Tačka Out je %s nakon posljednje sličice"

msgid "Out point is now %s; the window would be %s long, the existing\n  files are %s -- press Start above again."
msgstr "Tačka Out sada je %s; prozor bi trajao %s, postojeće\n  datoteke imaju %s -- pritisnite gore ponovo Pokreni."

msgid "Delivery usually takes the limited range. Full is not wrong, but some players misread it."
msgstr "Za isporuku se obično uzima ograničeni raspon. Puni nije pogrešan, ali ga neki plejeri ne čitaju ispravno."

msgid "Determines how auphonic.com processes the audio.\n\n\"%s\" leaves the key in place and still does not go there.\nThe audio is then only merged and normalised, not unmixed --\nand without separate tracks there is no camera cut."
msgstr "Određuje kako auphonic.com obrađuje zvuk.\n\n\"%s\" ostavlja ključ na mjestu, a ipak ne ide tamo.\nZvuk se tada samo spaja i normalizira, ne razdvaja --\na bez odvojenih traka nema reza kamera."

msgid "Distance to mean"
msgstr "Odstupanje od prosjeka"

msgid "Drag audio and video files here"
msgstr "Ovamo povucite audio i video datoteke"

msgid "Dry run: only measuring, nothing written, nothing uploaded."
msgstr "Probni prolaz: samo mjerenje, ništa se ne zapisuje, ništa se ne prenosi."

msgid "During greeting and farewell the picture stays wide."
msgstr "Tokom pozdrava i oproštaja slika ostaje široka."

msgid "The frames stand a little longer; the file is not any shorter for it. Editing software repeats about one frame every %s s, and picture and camera audio stay together."
msgstr "Sličice stoje nešto duže; datoteka time nije kraća. Softver za montažu zato ponavlja otprilike jednu sličicu svakih %s s, a slika i zvuk kamere ostaju zajedno."

msgid "The frames stand a little shorter; the file is not any longer for it. Editing software leaves out about one frame every %s s, and picture and camera audio stay together."
msgstr "Sličice stoje nešto kraće; datoteka time nije duža. Softver za montažu zato izostavlja otprilike jednu sličicu svakih %s s, a slika i zvuk kamere ostaju zajedno."

msgid "Eight bits are not enough for HDR: every gradient bands, and YouTube requires ten or twelve."
msgstr "Osam bita nije dovoljno za HDR: svaki gradijent stvara pruge, a YouTube zahtijeva deset ili dvanaest."

msgid "Envelope"
msgstr "Ovojnica"

msgid "  %s is placed on %s, which is no camera of this run -- the cut names it all the same."
msgstr "  %s stoji na %s, što nije kamera ovog prolaza -- rez svejedno koristi to ime."

msgid "Envelope failed: %s"
msgstr "Ovojnica nije uspjela: %s"

msgid "Envelopes and camera audio are prepared in the background."
msgstr "Ovojnice i zvuk kamere pripremaju se u pozadini."

msgid "Every row needs a name -- at Auphonic it becomes the track ID."
msgstr "Svaki red treba ime -- kod Auphonica ono postaje track ID."

msgid "External preview -- the app does not know this format"
msgstr "Vanjski pretpregled -- aplikacija ne poznaje ovaj format"

msgid "Fetching audio"
msgstr "Dohvatanje zvuka"

msgid "Fetching audio ..."
msgstr "Dohvatanje zvuka ..."

msgid "File"
msgstr "Datoteka"

msgid "Files are missing there -- without a new upload nothing can be computed.\n  With --auphonic-resume upload the script uploads again; this costs credit."
msgstr "Tamo nedostaju datoteke -- bez novog prijenosa ništa se ne može izračunati.\n  S --auphonic-resume upload skripta prenosi ponovo; to troši kredit."

msgid "For HDR the usual choice is HEVC (Main 10), AV1 or VP9 Profile 2. YouTube takes H.264 too, but it needs more bitrate."
msgstr "Za HDR je uobičajen izbor HEVC (Main 10), AV1 ili VP9 Profile 2. YouTube prima i H.264, ali mu treba veća brzina prijenosa."

msgid "For ten bits HEVC needs the Main 10 profile. In Resolve it sits under Deliver as \"Profile\"."
msgstr "Za deset bita HEVC treba profil Main 10. U Resolve se nalazi pod Deliver kao \"Profile\"."

msgid "%s fps, not the %s in the file -- %s fewer frames in the same length."
msgstr "%s fps, a ne %s iz datoteke -- %s sličica manje u istom trajanju."

msgid "%s fps, not the %s in the file -- %s more frames in the same length."
msgstr "%s fps, a ne %s iz datoteke -- %s sličica više u istom trajanju."

msgid "Frame spacing varies by %s %% -- the frame timing is uneven."
msgstr "Razmak sličica varira za %s %% -- vremenski raspored sličica nije ujednačen."

msgid "Free space there: %s"
msgstr "Slobodan prostor tamo: %s"

msgid "Gap of %s between block %d and %d -- the camera stopped."
msgstr "Praznina od %s između bloka %d i %d -- kamera je stala."

msgid "Drag to move the position."
msgstr "Povucite za pomjeranje položaja."

msgid "HDR needs 16 here (PQ, that is HDR10) or 18 (HLG). In Resolve: Gamma tag = ST.2084 or HLG. 14 is not an HDR curve but SDR in the BT.2020 space."
msgstr "HDR ovdje treba 16 (PQ, dakle HDR10) ili 18 (HLG). U Resolve: Gamma tag = ST.2084 ili HLG. 14 nije HDR krivulja, nego SDR u prostoru BT.2020."

msgid "HDR needs 9 here (BT.2020). In Resolve: Color space tag = Rec.2020."
msgstr "HDR ovdje treba 9 (BT.2020). U Resolve: Color space tag = Rec.2020."

msgid "HDR needs 9 here (BT.2020, non-constant luminance)."
msgstr "HDR ovdje treba 9 (BT.2020, nekonstantna luminancija)."

msgid "HLG is display-referred -- it has no entry for the mastering display."
msgstr "HLG je vezan za prikaz -- nema unos za mastering ekran."

msgid "If empty: next to each video file."
msgstr "Ako je prazno: pored svake video datoteke."

msgid "It arose during the recording and cannot be changed now. The less the microphones are separated, the more cautiously De-Bleed at auphonic.com can work. Next time: three times as far from the neighbouring microphone as from your own mouth, then the neighbouring voice sits about %s dB lower."
msgstr "Nastalo je tokom snimanja i sada se ne može promijeniti. Što su mikrofoni manje razdvojeni, to opreznije De-Bleed na auphonic.com može raditi. Sljedeći put: tri puta dalje od susjednog mikrofona nego od vlastitih usta, tada je susjedni glas oko %s dB tiši."

msgid "%s fits nothing in the material, so it cannot be cut into the episode: set to Intro."
msgstr "%s ne odgovara ničemu u materijalu, pa se ne može urezati u epizodu: postavljeno na Intro."

msgid "%s fits nothing in the material either, and the intro is taken: left out."
msgstr "%s također ne odgovara ničemu u materijalu, a intro je zauzet: izostavljeno."

msgid "%s is already set as %s, and an episode has one of those. Answer differently here, or take the mark off that file first."
msgstr "Datoteka %s već je postavljena kao %s, a epizoda ima samo jedan takav. Odgovorite ovdje drugačije ili najprije uklonite oznaku s te datoteke."

msgid "It is in the logs atom of the picture description -- that is how Resolve recognises the input colour space. Different curves mean different input colour spaces."
msgstr "To stoji u atomu logs u opisu slike -- po njemu Resolve prepoznaje ulazni prostor boja. Različite krivulje znače različite ulazne prostore boja."

msgid "Jumps to the end of the window."
msgstr "Skače na kraj prozora."

msgid "Jumps to the start of the window."
msgstr "Skače na početak prozora."

msgid "Keychain"
msgstr "Privjesak ključeva"

msgid "Limits the de-bleed: "
msgstr "Ograničava De-Bleed: "

msgid "Load Presets and pick one, or leave the API Key empty."
msgstr "Učitajte predefinirane postavke i odaberite jednu, ili ostavite API Key prazan."

msgid "Main10 rejected -- the default stays"
msgstr "Main10 odbijen -- ostaje zadana postavka"

msgid "Measure only -- nothing is written or uploaded."
msgstr "Samo izmjeri -- ništa se ne zapisuje niti se prenosi."

msgid "Measuring %s (%s of %s)"
msgstr "Mjeri se %s (%s od %s)"

msgid "Measuring not possible: %s"
msgstr "Mjerenje nije moguće: %s"

msgid "Measuring the yardstick"
msgstr "Mjerenje mjerila"

msgid "Measuring time axis ..."
msgstr "Mjerenje vremenske ose ..."

msgid "Missing audio %s filled with silence%s"
msgstr "Zvuk koji nedostaje %s popunjen tišinom%s"

msgid "Module DaVinciResolveScript cannot be loaded: %s"
msgstr "Modul DaVinciResolveScript ne može se učitati: %s"

msgid "One audio track per person, kept apart all the way to auphonic.com.\nWorks without it as well -- then without de-bleed and leveler.\nIt needs two input tracks: a recording of its own, a channel of a\nmultichannel recorder, or the audio of a video file set to \"use\nthe audio\". The camera cut does not need this tick."
msgstr "Jedna audio traka po osobi, držana odvojeno sve do auphonic.com.\nRadi i bez toga -- ali onda bez De-Bleeda i Levelera.\nPotrebne su dvije ulazne trake: vlastiti snimak, kanal\nvišekanalnog snimača ili zvuk video datoteke postavljene na\n\"koristi interni zvuk\". Rez kamera ne treba ovu kvačicu."

msgid "Multitrack (one track per speaker)"
msgstr "Multitrack (jedna traka po govorniku)"

msgid "Multitrack needs at least two input tracks. A track is a recording of its own, a channel of a multichannel recorder, or the audio of a video file set to \"use internal audio\". Several blocks of the same recording count as one, tracks set aside not at all."
msgstr "Multitrack treba barem dvije ulazne trake. Traka je vlastiti snimak, kanal višekanalnog snimača ili zvuk video datoteke postavljene na \"koristi interni zvuk\". Više blokova istog snimka računa se kao jedna, trake stavljene po strani uopće ne."

msgid "No API key. Pass --auphonic-api-key KEY, set AUPHONIC_TOKEN or have it remembered once in the interface. The key is in the Auphonic account settings."
msgstr "Nema API ključa. Zadajte --auphonic-api-key KLJUČ, postavite AUPHONIC_TOKEN ili ga jednom dajte zapamtiti u interfejsu. Ključ se nalazi u postavkama računa Auphonic."

msgid "No audio file carries a timecode. In point and Out point count from the start of the material -- the position of the files to each other is measured."
msgstr "Nijedna audio datoteka ne nosi vremenski kod. Tačka In i tačka Out broje se od početka materijala -- međusobni položaj datoteka je izmjeren."

msgid "No sound in use yet -- add an audio recording, or set a video file's Camera audio to \"use internal audio\" in the file list."
msgstr "Još se ne koristi nikakav zvuk -- dodajte audio snimak ili na listi datoteka postavite Zvuk kamere neke video datoteke na \"koristi interni zvuk\"."

msgid "No audio tracks are assigned."
msgstr "Nije dodijeljena nijedna audio traka."

msgid "No camera is assigned, so there is nothing to cut between."
msgstr "Nije dodijeljena nijedna kamera, pa nema između čega rezati."

msgid "No cameras assigned yet -- switch Multitrack on to do that."
msgstr "Još nema dodijeljenih kamera -- za to uključite Multitrack."

msgid "No connection to Resolve.\n  Is the program running? Is external scripting set to 'Local'\n  under Preferences > System > General?"
msgstr "Nema veze s Resolve.\n  Radi li program? Je li vanjsko skriptiranje postavljeno na 'Local'\n  pod Preferences > System > General?"

msgid "No files or project opened yet."
msgstr "Još nisu otvorene datoteke ni projekat."

msgid "No files selected yet."
msgstr "Još nisu odabrane datoteke."

msgid "No input possible. Use %s %s to set what should happen."
msgstr "Unos nije moguć. Pomoću %s %s odredite šta se treba dogoditi."

msgid "No player is built in here -- playback runs in ffplay in its own window."
msgstr "Ovdje nije ugrađen plejer -- reprodukcija se izvodi u ffplay u vlastitom prozoru."

msgid "No preset given, no input possible. Choose one of the above with --auphonic-preset NAME."
msgstr "Nije zadana predefinirana postavka, unos nije moguć. Odaberite jednu od gornjih pomoću --auphonic-preset NAZIV."

msgid "No presets stored in the account. One can be created in the web interface."
msgstr "Na računu nema sačuvanih predefiniranih postavki. Može se kreirati u web interfejsu."

msgid "No speaker is known here -- without who speaks when there is nothing to cut between."
msgstr "Ovdje nije poznat nijedan govornik -- bez toga ko kada govori nema između čega rezati."

msgid "No voice has a camera yet -- with that every shot would be the same one."
msgstr "Nijedan glas još nema kameru -- tako bi svaki kadar bio isti."

msgid "No speakers known yet -- nothing measured, nothing separated, and no handover file of an earlier run in %s or its subfolders."
msgstr "Još nema poznatih govornika -- ništa izmjereno, ništa razdvojeno i nema datoteke predaje iz ranijeg prolaza u %s ni u njegovim podfolderima."

msgid "Not found again after import: %s"
msgstr "Nakon uvoza nije ponovo pronađeno: %s"

msgid "from ffmpeg.org, and the folder into PATH"
msgstr "sa ffmpeg.org, a folder u PATH"

msgid "over the package manager: apt install ffmpeg, dnf install ffmpeg"
msgstr "preko upravitelja paketa: apt install ffmpeg, dnf install ffmpeg"

msgid "Here: %s. Needed: %s or newer."
msgstr "Ovdje: %s. Potrebno: %s ili novije."

msgid "no answer"
msgstr "nema odgovora"

msgid "Nothing runs until that is put right."
msgstr "Ništa ne radi dok se to ne ispravi."

msgid "Nothing runs until that is put right. This way: %s"
msgstr "Dok se to ne ispravi, ništa ne radi. Ovako: %s"

msgid "Get it: %s"
msgstr "Dohvati: %s"

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Izađi"

msgid "That worked."
msgstr "To je uspjelo."

msgid "Installing ffmpeg"
msgstr "Instalacija ffmpeg-a"

msgid "Start the program again to pick it up."
msgstr "Ponovo pokrenite program da to preuzme."

msgid "Getting it takes a few minutes, and what it says appears under Output."
msgstr "Dohvatanje traje nekoliko minuta, a ono što kaže pojavljuje se pod Izlaz."

msgid "This takes a few minutes -- a package manager may build from source. What it says appears here."
msgstr "To traje nekoliko minuta -- upravitelj paketa možda gradi iz izvornog koda. Ono što kaže pojavljuje se ovdje."

msgid "Now it is being compiled, and that is the long part: minutes on a fast machine and a good deal longer on an older one. Nothing is stuck -- a dot appears every few seconds for as long as it works."
msgstr "Sada se prevodi, a to je dugi dio: minute na brzom računaru i znatno duže na starijem. Ništa nije zapelo -- dok god radi, svakih nekoliko sekundi pojavljuje se tačka."

msgid "ffmpeg is in place."
msgstr "ffmpeg je instaliran."

msgid "The program reads it when it starts. It can start again now, or you can do that yourself later."
msgstr "Program ga čita pri pokretanju. Može se sada ponovo pokrenuti, ili to možete sami uraditi kasnije."

msgid "Start again now"
msgstr "Ponovo pokreni sada"

msgid "Starting again did not work. Close the window and start the program the way you did before."
msgstr "Ponovno pokretanje nije uspjelo. Zatvorite prozor i pokrenite program kao i prije."

msgid "  Taking the ffmpeg that is there out of the way first: %s"
msgstr "  Prvo se postojeći ffmpeg uklanja s puta: %s"

msgid "  A built ffmpeg 9.0.1 with soxr can be fetched: %s"
msgstr "  Gotov ffmpeg 9.0.1 sa soxr može se preuzeti: %s"

msgid "  Fetch it now? [Y/n] "
msgstr "  Preuzeti sada? [Y/n] "

msgid "  Fetching a built ffmpeg. It is a big one, so this takes a few minutes: %s"
msgstr "  Preuzima se gotov ffmpeg. Velik je, pa ovo traje nekoliko minuta: %s"

msgid "  %s of %s MB"
msgstr "  %s od %s MB"

msgid "The build could not be fetched: %s"
msgstr "Gotovu verziju nije bilo moguće preuzeti: %s"

msgid "  The build could not be unpacked: %s"
msgstr "  Gotovu verziju nije bilo moguće raspakovati: %s"

msgid "  The archive held %s of the two programs."
msgstr "  Arhiva je sadržavala %s od dva programa."

msgid "  It is here: %s"
msgstr "  Nalazi se ovdje: %s"

msgid "install Homebrew from brew.sh, then this again"
msgstr "instalirati Homebrew sa brew.sh, zatim ponovo ovo"

msgid "This ffmpeg has soxr: the clock drift between cameras comes out in steps of 0.21 ppm."
msgstr "Ovaj ffmpeg ima soxr: drift sata između kamera izlazi u koracima od 0,21 ppm."

msgid "This ffmpeg has no soxr: the clock drift between cameras comes out in steps of 21 ppm instead of 0.21."
msgstr "Ovaj ffmpeg nema soxr: drift sata između kamera izlazi u koracima od 21 ppm umjesto 0,21."

msgid "Everything works without it. Getting a build that has it takes a few minutes, and what it says appears under Output."
msgstr "Sve radi i bez toga. Dohvatanje verzije koja to ima traje nekoliko minuta, a ono što kaže pojavljuje se pod Izlaz."

msgid "Carry on"
msgstr "Nastavi"

msgid "Not mandatory -- YouTube then applies default values (Sony BVM-X300). To get them: in Resolve switch on HDR10+ under Color Management, run \"Analyze All Shots\" on the Color page and tick \"Embed HDR10 Metadata\" when rendering."
msgstr "Nije obavezno -- YouTube tada primjenjuje zadane vrijednosti (Sony BVM-X300). Ko ih želi: u Resolve pod Color Management uključiti HDR10+, na stranici Color pokrenuti \"Analyze All Shots\" i pri renderiranju označiti \"Embed HDR10 Metadata\"."

msgid "Not ready yet:"
msgstr "Još nije spremno:"

msgid "Nothing was audible in the tracks."
msgstr "U trakama se ništa nije čulo."

msgid "One audio recording has no speaker name yet."
msgstr "Jedan audio snimak još nema ime govornika."

msgid "One frame back."
msgstr "Jedna sličica nazad."

msgid "One second back."
msgstr "Jedna sekunda nazad."

msgid "Each shot in the colour of its camera. Hover for camera and duration, click to jump."
msgstr "Svaki kadar u boji svoje kamere. Pređite mišem za kameru i trajanje, kliknite za skok."

msgid "Only one speaker"
msgstr "Samo jedan govornik"

msgid "Open json project file"
msgstr "Otvori datoteku projekta json"

msgid "Open result folder"
msgstr "Otvori folder s rezultatom"

msgid "Open the settings, where the key is."
msgstr "Otvara postavke, gdje se nalazi ključ."

msgid "Order does not matter. For a multi-part recording the first block is enough."
msgstr "Redoslijed nije važan. Kod višedijelnog snimka dovoljan je prvi blok."

msgid "Overwrite"
msgstr "Prebriši"

msgid "Overwrite files"
msgstr "Prebriši datoteke"

msgid "Pane %d loads %s (%s)"
msgstr "Okno %d učitava %s (%s)"

msgid "Pane %d on %s"
msgstr "Okno %d na %s"

msgid "Play and pause -- the space bar works too."
msgstr "Reproduciraj i pauziraj -- radi i razmaknica."

msgid "Play and pause."
msgstr "Reproduciraj i pauziraj."

msgid "Playback not possible"
msgstr "Reprodukcija nije moguća"

msgid "Playing %s -- the processed track from auphonic.com,\nbrought to broadcast level. The same audio as in the camera cut."
msgstr "Reproducira se %s -- obrađena traka s auphonic.com,\ndovedena na nivo emitiranja. Isti zvuk kao u rezu kamera."

msgid "Playing %s -- the raw recording.\nIt is much quieter than the processed audio; once the tracks from auphonic.com\nare there, the preview takes those."
msgstr "Reproducira se %s -- sirovi snimak.\nMnogo je tiši od obrađenog zvuka; čim trake s auphonic.com\nbudu tu, pretpregled uzima njih."

msgid "Possible reasons:\n  1. Resolve is not running -- the interface answers only while the program runs.\n  2. Preferences > System > General: external scripting is set to \"None\" instead of \"Local\".\n  3. Free edition: external scripting is reported to be reserved for the Studio edition since version 19.1. I found no official statement -- this check measures it instead of claiming it."
msgstr "Mogući razlozi:\n  1. Resolve ne radi -- interfejs odgovara samo dok program radi.\n  2. Preferences > System > General: vanjsko skriptiranje postavljeno je na \"None\" umjesto \"Local\".\n  3. Besplatno izdanje: vanjsko skriptiranje navodno je od verzije 19.1 rezervirano za izdanje Studio. Službenu izjavu o tome nisam našao -- ova provjera to mjeri umjesto da to tvrdi."

msgid "Prepare pane %d for %s"
msgstr "Pripremi okno %d za %s"

msgid "Preset not readable: %s"
msgstr "Predefinirana postavka nije čitljiva: %s"

msgid "Preview not possible: %s"
msgstr "Pretpregled nije moguć: %s"

msgid "Preview running ..."
msgstr "Pretpregled u toku ..."

msgid "Prework -- read audio and compute envelopes:\n"
msgstr "Priprema -- učitati zvuk i izračunati ovojnice:\n"

msgid "Primaries"
msgstr "Primarne boje"

msgid "Primaries number %d"
msgstr "Primarne boje broj %d"

msgid "Processing at auphonic.com (optional)"
msgstr "Obrada na auphonic.com (neobavezno)"

msgid "Processing at auphonic.com with \"%s\""
msgstr "Obrada na auphonic.com s \"%s\""

msgid "Production finished, but no ZIP with the individual tracks"
msgstr "Produkcija završena, ali nema ZIP-a s pojedinačnim trakama"

msgid "Production name"
msgstr "Naziv produkcije"

msgid "Chosen files"
msgstr "Odabrane datoteke"

msgid "Remove the chosen file from the list"
msgstr "Ukloni odabranu datoteku sa liste"

msgid "Project %r could not be created."
msgstr "Projekat %r nije se mogao kreirati."

msgid "Project %r could not be created. Is the name already in another folder?"
msgstr "Projekat %r nije se mogao kreirati. Postoji li to ime već u drugom folderu?"

msgid "Project %r could not be opened."
msgstr "Projekat %r nije se mogao otvoriti."

msgid "Puts it back next to each video file."
msgstr "Vraća ga pored svake video datoteke."

msgid "ROLLBACK FAILED (%s)"
msgstr "VRAĆANJE NIJE USPJELO (%s)"

msgid "Reading audio track from %s"
msgstr "Čitanje audio trake iz %s"

msgid "Resolutions"
msgstr "Rezolucije"

msgid "Resolve running ..."
msgstr "Resolve radi ..."

msgid "Resolve scales to the Timeline resolution. Anything smaller is scaled up and gets softer."
msgstr "Resolve skalira na rezoluciju Timeline. Sve manje se povećava i postaje mekše."

msgid "Response was not JSON: %s"
msgstr "Odgovor nije bio JSON: %s"

msgid "Rows marked red show where the problem is; a tick on the tab means everything is there."
msgstr "Crveno označeni redovi pokazuju gdje je problem; kvačica na kartici znači da je tamo sve na mjestu."

msgid "Save in Keychain"
msgstr "Sačuvaj u privjesak ključeva"

msgid "Save in Registry"
msgstr "Sačuvaj u registar"

msgid "Select audio and video files"
msgstr "Odaberi audio i video datoteke"

msgid "Speakers, as the run measured them"
msgstr "Govornici, kako ih je prolaz izmjerio"

msgid "Speakers, self-measured from the tracks"
msgstr "Govornici, izmjereni programom iz traka"

msgid "Started late or stopped early -- this voice is then missing from the mix in places."
msgstr "Pokrenuto kasno ili zaustavljeno rano -- ovaj glas tada mjestimično nedostaje u miksu."

msgid "Stopped. Choose another production name -- then a new production\n  is created -- or pick one of the other options."
msgstr "Zaustavljeno. Odaberite drugi naziv produkcije -- tada se kreira nova\n  produkcija -- ili odaberite jednu od ostalih mogućnosti."

msgid "Stopped. Nothing was created."
msgstr "Zaustavljeno. Ništa nije kreirano."

msgid "Stopped. Nothing was uploaded and nothing computed."
msgstr "Zaustavljeno. Ništa nije preneseno i ništa nije izračunato."

msgid "Used as it stands -- nothing is invented. Check in Resolve under Clip Attributes, tab Color Space: if it says \"Project\" there, the input colour space was not recognised and has to be set by hand."
msgstr "Koristi se kako stoji -- ništa se ne izmišlja. Provjerite u Resolve pod Clip Attributes, kartica Color Space: ako tamo piše \"Project\", ulazni prostor boja nije prepoznat i mora se ručno postaviti."

msgid "Takes the position from the picture."
msgstr "Preuzima položaj iz slike."

msgid "Ten seconds back."
msgstr "Deset sekundi nazad."

msgid "The Resolve interface is not where I expect it:\n  %s\n  %s"
msgstr "Interfejs za Resolve nije tamo gdje ga očekujem:\n  %s\n  %s"

msgid "The Resolve interface is not where it should be."
msgstr "Interfejs za Resolve nije tamo gdje bi trebao biti."

msgid "The Timeline gets one fixed rate -- the highest of them, or the next rate Resolve has above it. It converts the others; with 23.976 against 24 that is where its audio analysis tends to stall."
msgstr "Timeline dobija jednu fiksnu brzinu -- najvišu od njih, ili sljedeću višu koju Resolve ima. Ostale pretvara; kod 23,976 prema 24 njegova analiza zvuka često zapinje."

msgid "The audio recording of every speaker, plus the cameras.\nThe order does not matter -- the program recognises what is what.\nFor a multi-part recording the first block is enough."
msgstr "Audio snimak svakog govornika, uz to kamere.\nRedoslijed nije važan -- program prepoznaje šta je šta.\nKod višedijelnog snimka dovoljan je prvi blok."

msgid "The cut has no picture there. When the Timeline is built the spot stays empty, the audio runs on."
msgstr "Rez tamo nema sliku. Pri izradi Timeline mjesto ostaje prazno, zvuk teče dalje."

msgid "The existing result is unusable: %s is missing there. With --auphonic-resume rerun it can be recomputed without uploading anything."
msgstr "Postojeći rezultat je neupotrebljiv: tamo nedostaje %s. S --auphonic-resume rerun može se ponovo izračunati bez ikakvog prijenosa."

msgid "The cut rules leave no shot standing in these %s. A shorter shortest shot, or less wide shot, gives one again."
msgstr "Pravila reza ne ostavljaju nijedan kadar u ovih %s. Kraći najkraći kadar ili manje širokog kadra opet daje jedan."

msgid "The programme is %s long here -- nothing can be laid out in that. In point and Out point are what set it."
msgstr "Emisija je ovdje duga %s -- u to se ne može ništa rasporediti. To određuju tačka In i tačka Out."

msgid "The time window lies outside the material: In point at %s, Out point at %s, and the material runs %s."
msgstr "Vremenski prozor leži izvan materijala: tačka In na %s, tačka Out na %s, a materijal traje %s."

msgid "The first preset track sets the settings for all our tracks. Otherwise they come back unprocessed. Create a track in the preset in the web interface."
msgstr "Prva traka predefinirane postavke određuje postavke za sve naše trake. Inače se vraćaju neobrađene. Kreirajte traku u predefiniranoj postavci u web interfejsu."

msgid "That needs the handover file from a run, and there is none."
msgstr "Za to treba datoteka predaje iz prolaza, a nema je."

msgid "The key can only be stored on Mac and Windows -- in the keychain or the registry. It does not go into a file."
msgstr "Ključ se može sačuvati samo na Macu i Windowsu -- u privjesak ključeva ili u registar. Ne ide u datoteku."

msgid "%s -- being checked"
msgstr "%s -- provjerava se"

msgid "The key was not saved: %s"
msgstr "Ključ nije sačuvan: %s"

msgid "The keychain is locked. Unlock it and try again."
msgstr "Privjesak ključeva je zaključan. Otključajte ga i pokušajte ponovo."

msgid "This run is a test run and the store still carries its real name, so nothing was written. Point KEY_SERVICE, KEY_ACCOUNT or REG_PATH somewhere else first."
msgstr "Ovaj prolaz je testni, a spremište još nosi svoje pravo ime, pa ništa nije zapisano. Najprije usmjerite KEY_SERVICE, KEY_ACCOUNT ili REG_PATH drugamo."

msgid "The keychain is locked. Unlock it and this button wakes up."
msgstr "Privjesak ključeva je zaključan. Otključajte ga i ovo dugme se budi."

msgid "The keychain did not take the key. Keychain Access can say why."
msgstr "Privjesak ključeva nije prihvatio ključ. Pristup privjesku ključeva može reći zašto."

msgid "The registry did not take the key."
msgstr "Registar nije prihvatio ključ."

msgid "Open Keychain Access"
msgstr "Otvori Pristup privjesku ključeva"

msgid "Opens the app that unlocks the keychain."
msgstr "Otvara aplikaciju koja otključava privjesak ključeva."

msgid "  Keychain Access could not be opened: %s"
msgstr "  Pristup privjesku ključeva nije bilo moguće otvoriti: %s"

msgid "The stored key is not accepted: %s"
msgstr "Sačuvani ključ nije prihvaćen: %s"

msgid "The key from AUPHONIC_TOKEN is not accepted: %s"
msgstr "Ključ iz AUPHONIC_TOKEN nije prihvaćen: %s"

msgid "What auphonic.com replied"
msgstr "Šta je odgovorio auphonic.com"

msgid "There is no key."
msgstr "Nema ključa."

msgid "The key has a space or a line break at one end."
msgstr "Ključ na jednom kraju ima razmak ili prelom reda."

msgid "The key is broken in the middle by a space or a line break."
msgstr "Ključ je u sredini prekinut razmakom ili prelomom reda."

msgid "The key has a character in it that cannot be typed."
msgstr "Ključ sadrži znak koji se ne može upisati."

msgid "The key is then in the %s, never in a file."
msgstr "Ključ tada ne ide u datoteku, nego ovamo: %s."

msgid "The production has no name yet."
msgstr "Produkcija još nema naziv."

msgid "The recording assigned to this camera instead of the camera audio."
msgstr "Umjesto zvuka kamere snimak koji je dodijeljen ovoj kameri."

msgid "The run is still going."
msgstr "Prolaz još traje."

msgid "No speakers are known yet -- they are worked out of the tracks as soon as this tab is opened. Where everybody is on one recording, \"several speakers\" in the Speaker name field is the way."
msgstr "Još nema poznatih govornika -- utvrđuju se iz traka čim se otvori ova kartica. Gdje su svi na jednom snimku, put je \"više govornika\" u polju Ime govornika."

msgid "The three numbers are primaries, curve and matrix. Different tags need different input colour spaces in Resolve -- otherwise one camera looks unlike the other."
msgstr "Tri broja su primarne boje, krivulja i matrica. Različite oznake trebaju različite ulazne prostore boja u Resolve -- inače jedna kamera izgleda drugačije od druge."

msgid "There are no separate audio recordings. Then the audio of the %s cameras is used -- each becomes a track, and Auphonic removes the bleed."
msgstr "Nema zasebnih audio snimaka. Tada se koristi zvuk kamera, njih %s -- svaka postaje traka, a Auphonic uklanja preslušavanje."

msgid "There is no result yet."
msgstr "Još nema rezultata."

msgid "These files are neither audio nor video and stay out:\n\n  %s"
msgstr "Ove datoteke nisu ni zvuk ni video i ostaju izostavljene:\n\n  %s"

msgid "These files do not exist:\n  "
msgstr "Ove datoteke ne postoje:\n  "

msgid "These files exist already and will be written again:\n\n  %s\n\nIs that intended?"
msgstr "Ove datoteke već postoje i bit će ponovo zapisane:\n\n  %s\n\nJe li to namjerno?"

msgid "These files no longer exist:\n  "
msgstr "Ove datoteke više ne postoje:\n  "

msgid "These names occur more than once:\n\n  %s\n\nThe recordings are merged into one track and laid end to end by their timecode. That is right if recording was stopped in between."
msgstr "Ova se imena pojavljuju više puta:\n\n  %s\n\nSnimci se spajaju u jednu traku i nižu jedan za drugim po svom vremenskom kodu. To je ispravno ako je snimanje u međuvremenu bilo zaustavljeno."

msgid "These tracks got no file: %s"
msgstr "Ove trake nisu dobile datoteku: %s"

msgid "This Resolve project already exists"
msgstr "Ovaj Resolve projekat već postoji"

msgid "This comes from the recording, not afterwards: the microphones sit too close together or too far from the mouth."
msgstr "Ovo dolazi iz snimanja, a ne poslije: mikrofoni su preblizu jedan drugom ili predaleko od usta."

msgid "This file cannot be played here, and ffplay is missing as a fallback."
msgstr "Ova se datoteka ovdje ne može reproducirati, a ffplay kao rezervno rješenje nedostaje."

msgid "This is not a project file, and there is none in the same folder.\n\nThe search is for %s*.json -- the script writes it into the output folder at start."
msgstr "Ovo nije datoteka projekta, a u istom folderu nema nijedne.\n\nTraži se %s*.json -- skripta je pri pokretanju zapisuje u izlazni folder."

msgid "This is what happens next"
msgstr "Ovo slijedi"

msgid "This name is on somebody else already. A name is a person, and the cut puts a person on one camera -- please give this voice its own."
msgstr "Ovo ime već nosi neko drugi. Ime je osoba, a rez stavlja jednu osobu na jednu kameru -- dajte ovom glasu vlastito."

msgid "This name occurs more than once. The recordings would become one track -- for Multitrack auphonic.com needs at least two different ones."
msgstr "Ovo se ime pojavljuje više puta. Snimci bi postali jedna traka -- za Multitrack auphonic.com treba barem dvije različite."

msgid "This production already exists"
msgstr "Ova produkcija već postoji"

msgid "This production has no result yet."
msgstr "Ova produkcija još nema rezultat."

msgid "Time limit of %s reached, production still running: %s/engine/status/%s"
msgstr "Dostignuto vremensko ograničenje od %s, produkcija još traje: %s/engine/status/%s"

msgid "Timecode %s, the other files are at %s -- this clock was not set."
msgstr "Vremenski kod %s, ostale datoteke su na %s -- ovaj sat nije bio namješten."

msgid "Timeline %r could not be created."
msgstr "Timeline %r nije se mogao kreirati."

msgid "Title at auphonic.com and start of the new file names."
msgstr "Naslov na auphonic.com i početak novih naziva datoteka."

msgid "To the In point."
msgstr "Na tačku In."

msgid "To the start."
msgstr "Na početak."

msgid "Too many projects with this name."
msgstr "Previše projekata s ovim imenom."

msgid "Track"
msgstr "Traka"

msgid "Tracks were added while changing (now %s). That makes the mix\n  wrong. Please delete the tracks without a file at auphonic.com."
msgstr "Tokom promjene dodane su trake (sada %s). Time miks postaje\n  pogrešan. Izbrišite na auphonic.com trake bez datoteke."

msgid "Two cameras would produce the same file. The second would overwrite the first."
msgstr "Dvije bi kamere dale istu datoteku. Druga bi prebrisala prvu."

msgid "Two cameras would produce the same file: %s"
msgstr "Dvije kamere bi proizvele istu datoteku: %s"

msgid "Two cameras would produce the same new file. Please give different names."
msgstr "Dvije kamere dale bi istu novu datoteku. Dajte im različite nazive."

msgid "Uneven frame timing cannot be evened out through the audio. If the sample points spread during alignment as well, convert to a fixed frame rate."
msgstr "Neujednačen vremenski raspored sličica ne može se izravnati preko zvuka. Ako se pri poravnavanju rasipaju i tačke uzorkovanja, pretvorite u fiksnu brzinu sličica."

msgid "Video"
msgstr "Video"

msgid "Video 1"
msgstr "Video 1"

msgid "Video 2"
msgstr "Video 2"

msgid "Video Podcast Magic %s -- raw material becomes an edited podcast"
msgstr "Video Podcast Magic %s -- od sirovog materijala nastaje montirani podcast"

msgid "Volume. 100 is as loud as it goes -- Qt takes nothing above that."
msgstr "Jačina zvuka. 100 je najglasnije što ide -- Qt ne prima ništa iznad toga."

msgid "%s (%s) -- talking at once counts twice"
msgstr "%s (%s) -- istovremeni govor računa se dvostruko"

msgid "Wide shot at most"
msgstr "Široki kadar najviše"

msgid "Wide shot at the latest"
msgstr "Široki kadar najkasnije"

msgid "Wide shot for greeting at the start and farewell at the end"
msgstr "Široki kadar za pozdrav na početku i oproštaj na kraju"

msgid "Without it every player has to guess, and all guess SDR. In Resolve under Deliver > Advanced Settings set the Color space tag and the Gamma tag instead of leaving them at \"Same as Project\"."
msgstr "Bez toga svaki plejer mora pogađati, a svi pogađaju SDR. U Resolve pod Deliver > Advanced Settings postavite Color space tag i Gamma tag umjesto da ih ostavite na \"Same as Project\"."

msgid "Without processing at auphonic.com"
msgstr "Bez obrade na auphonic.com"

msgid "There is no camera cut yet: it needs two people, each with a name and a camera.\nSeparate recordings give that with the Multitrack tick, and so does \"several speakers\" in the Speaker name field of one recording --\nthe voices found there get their camera in the table under the recordings.\nA Resolve project is created anyway -- all cameras at their measured places, ready for Multicam."
msgstr "Još nema reza kamera: potrebne su dvije osobe, svaka s imenom i kamerom.\nOdvojeni snimci to daju s kvačicom Multitrack, a isto tako i \"više govornika\" u polju Ime govornika jednog snimka --\nglasovi tamo pronađeni dobijaju svoju kameru u tabeli ispod snimaka.\nResolve projekat svejedno nastaje -- sve kamere na svojim izmjerenim mjestima, spremne za Multicam."

msgid "Without timecode the position of the files is measured."
msgstr "Bez vremenskog koda položaj datoteka se mjeri."

msgid "Works out who speaks when from the tracks themselves -- one microphone per person, level against its own noise floor. Where everybody is on one recording, \"several speakers\" in the Speaker name field is the way."
msgstr "Iz samih traka utvrđuje ko kada govori -- jedan mikrofon po osobi, nivo prema vlastitom šumu pozadine. Gdje su svi na jednom snimku, put je \"više govornika\" u polju Ime govornika."

msgid "YouTube -- turns down only, never up"
msgstr "YouTube -- samo stišava, nikad ne pojačava"

msgid "a box no longer fits into its parent"
msgstr "box više ne stane u svoj nadređeni box"

msgid "after the device change"
msgstr "nakon promjene uređaja"

msgid "auphonic.com does not accept the key: %s"
msgstr "auphonic.com ne prihvata ključ: %s"

msgid "average"
msgstr "prosjek"

msgid "belongs to"
msgstr "pripada"

msgid "bleed too indistinct: %s of %s seconds usable, sharpest %s of %s needed"
msgstr "preslušavanje previše nejasno: upotrebljivo %s od %s sekundi, najoštrijih potrebno %s od %s"

msgid "Midnight"
msgstr "Ponoć"

msgid "%s carries a timecode from the other side of midnight -- counted as one night, not as a day apart."
msgstr "%s nosi vremenski kod s druge strane ponoći -- računa se kao jedna noć, a ne kao dan razlike."

msgid "A timecode counts from midnight and starts over there. The files are put on one axis before anything is subtracted, otherwise the recording after midnight looks almost a day away from the one before. If these really were recorded on different days, the alignment is wrong and the measured offset is the one to trust."
msgstr "Vremenski kod broji od ponoći i tamo počinje iznova. Datoteke se stavljaju na jednu osu prije nego što se išta oduzme, inače snimak nakon ponoći izgleda gotovo dan udaljen od onog prije. Ako se ovdje zaista snimalo različitih dana, poravnanje je pogrešno i vrijedi izmjereni pomak."

msgid "Channel %d is against the stop: %s times three samples or more in a row, the longest %s (%s ms), the first at %s."
msgstr "Kanal %d je na graničniku: %s puta tri ili više uzoraka zaredom, najduži %s (%s ms), prvi u %s."

msgid "Counted here, sample by sample, at the rate the file was recorded at: a run of three or more samples on the highest value an integer format can hold. One or two are rounding and are not reported. What is cut off there is gone and no processing brings it back -- but the recording is still the recording, and this holds nothing up. Only integer formats are counted. 32 bit float has no stop at full scale, so there is nothing there to count."
msgstr "Ovdje se broji uzorak po uzorak, pri frekvenciji kojom je datoteka snimljena: niz od tri ili više uzoraka na najvišoj vrijednosti koju cjelobrojni format može držati. Jedan ili dva su zaokruživanje i ne prijavljuju se. Što je tamo odrezano, nestalo je i nikakva ga obrada ne vraća -- ali snimak je i dalje snimak, i ovo ništa ne zaustavlja. Broje se samo cjelobrojni formati. 32-bitni pomični zarez nema graničnik na punoj skali, pa tamo nema šta brojati."

msgid "boxes no longer readable"
msgstr "boxovi više nisu čitljivi"

msgid "bring up to date -- both Timelines are deleted and\n       rebuilt, the media pool stays as it is"
msgstr "ažurirati -- oba Timeline se brišu i\n       ponovo grade, Media Pool ostaje kakav je"

msgid "cannot be read back (%s)"
msgstr "ne može se ponovo pročitati (%s)"

msgid "checking ..."
msgstr "provjera ..."

msgid "complete"
msgstr "potpuno"

msgid "create a new project alongside (name with suffix)"
msgstr "kreirati novi projekat pored (ime s dodatkom)"

msgid "curl ended with %d"
msgstr "curl je završio s %d"

msgid "did not arrive: %s"
msgstr "nije stiglo: %s"

msgid "does not belong: %s"
msgstr "ne pripada: %s"

msgid "does not exist: %s"
msgstr "ne postoji: %s"

msgid "does the material fit together?"
msgstr "pristaje li materijal zajedno?"

msgid "does the preset fit the run?"
msgstr "odgovara li predefinirana postavka prolazu?"

msgid "downloaded file is only %s bytes"
msgstr "preuzeta datoteka ima samo %s bajtova"

msgid "gap of %s per timecode, too far apart for one recording"
msgstr "praznina od %s po vremenskom kodu, predaleko za jedan snimak"

msgid "gets audio from"
msgstr "dobija zvuk iz"

msgid "hear assigned audio"
msgstr "slušaj dodijeljeni zvuk"

msgid "keep our names and upload everything again -- this costs\n       credit"
msgstr "zadržati naše nazive i sve ponovo prenijeti -- to troši\n       kredit"

msgid "leave it and put the new Timelines alongside --\n       the existing ones stay"
msgstr "ostaviti i nove Timeline staviti pored --\n       postojeći ostaju"

msgid "missing -- the container carries no colour tagging"
msgstr "nedostaje -- kontejner ne nosi oznake boje"

msgid "missing: %s"
msgstr "nedostaje: %s"

msgid "moov has not grown"
msgstr "moov nije narastao"

msgid "moov is no longer in its place"
msgstr "moov više nije na svom mjestu"

msgid "moov no longer ends at the end of the file"
msgstr "moov više ne završava na kraju datoteke"

msgid "multi-part, no timecode -- gaps in between cannot be detected."
msgstr "višedijelno, bez vremenskog koda -- praznine između dijelova ne mogu se otkriti."

msgid "new file name"
msgstr "novi naziv datoteke"

msgid "next to each video file"
msgstr "pored svake video datoteke"

msgid "no audio data from %s"
msgstr "nema audio podataka iz %s"

msgid "no audio track present"
msgstr "nema audio trake"

msgid "no audio: %s"
msgstr "nema zvuka: %s"

msgid "no download address for %s"
msgstr "nema adrese za preuzimanje za %s"

msgid "no information"
msgstr "nema podataka"

msgid "no information in the file"
msgstr "nema podataka u datoteci"

msgid "no match in the middle either (%s)"
msgstr "ni u sredini nema podudaranja (%s)"

msgid "no place found where exactly one person speaks -- the separation cannot be measured."
msgstr "nije pronađeno mjesto gdje govori tačno jedna osoba -- razdvajanje se ne može izmjeriti."

msgid "no production id in the response"
msgstr "u odgovoru nema id-a produkcije"

msgid "no production id in the response: %s"
msgstr "u odgovoru nema id-a produkcije: %s"

msgid "no timecode"
msgstr "bez vremenskog koda"

msgid "no video track"
msgstr "nema video trake"

msgid "no video track in %s"
msgstr "nema video trake u %s"

