msgstr "\nBEZ AUPHONIC.COM"

msgid "  Bleed measured, %s in %s only %s dB quieter -- taken out of the speech detection"
msgstr "  Preslušavanje izmjereno, %s u %s samo %s dB tiše -- izuzeto iz detekcije govora"

msgid "  Bleed not separable: %s"
msgstr "  Preslušavanje se ne može razdvojiti: %s"

msgid "  No moment found where exactly one person speaks -- the bleed stays in the speech detection."
msgstr "  Nije pronađen trenutak u kojem govori tačno jedna osoba -- preslušavanje ostaje u detekciji govora."

msgid "  Nothing was audible in the tracks -- no camera cut from this."
msgstr "  U trakama se ništa nije čulo -- iz toga nema reza kamera."

msgid "  Not in the cut: %s -- a separation speaks for the recording, or it was not measured."
msgstr "  Nije u rezu: %s -- za snimak govori razdvajanje, ili traka nije izmjerena."

msgid "  The tracks are used as recorded: aligned, mixed and brought to the\n  target loudness. No de-bleed, no leveler, no noise removal -- for\n  those the run needs auphonic.com."
msgstr "  Trake se koriste kako su snimljene: poravnate, miksane i dovedene na\n  ciljnu glasnoću. Bez De-Bleeda, bez Levelera, bez uklanjanja šuma -- za\n  to prolaz treba auphonic.com."

msgid "  --without-auphonic and --auphonic-done were both given. The finished tracks win: there is nothing left to send anywhere."
msgstr "  Navedeni su i --without-auphonic i --auphonic-done. Gotove trake imaju prednost: nema više ničega što bi se bilo kuda slalo."

msgid "MULTITRACK NOT POSSIBLE\n  Without an API key there is nothing to send to auphonic.com.\n  With --without-auphonic it runs locally instead: aligned,\n  mixed and cut, but without de-bleed and leveler."
msgstr "MULTITRACK NIJE MOGUĆ\n  Bez API ključa nema šta poslati na auphonic.com.\n  S --without-auphonic umjesto toga radi lokalno: poravnato,\n  miksano i rezano, ali bez De-Bleeda i bez Levelera."

msgid "  Caution: only %s of %s pairs measurable. For the rest no moment was found where exactly one person speaks, so their bleed stays in -- the speaker detection is unreliable here."
msgstr "  Oprez: mjerljivo je samo %s od %s parova. Za ostale nije pronađen trenutak u kojem govori tačno jedna osoba, pa njihovo preslušavanje ostaje -- detekcija govornika ovdje je nepouzdana."

msgid "the microphones hear each other almost as loudly as their own speaker"
msgstr "mikrofoni čuju jedan drugoga gotovo jednako glasno kao vlastitog govornika"

msgid "the tracks are too much alike to separate"
msgstr "trake su previše slične da bi se razdvojile"

msgid "Reading the plan"
msgstr "Čitanje plana"

msgid "Audio out of the cameras"
msgstr "Zvuk iz kamera"

msgid "Common time axis"
msgstr "Zajednička vremenska osa"

msgid "Processing at auphonic.com"
msgstr "Obrada na auphonic.com"

msgid "Loudness"
msgstr "Glasnoća"

msgid "Loudness and levels"
msgstr "Glasnoća i nivoi"

msgid "Loudness of the finished episode"
msgstr "Glasnoća gotove epizode"

msgid "How loud the finished episode is made. The same gain goes on every\ntrack, so the balance between the speakers is kept.\n\"Take from source files\" adjusts nothing at all: auphonic.com goes\non doing what its preset says, and without auphonic.com the sound\nstays as it is in the source files."
msgstr "Koliko glasno se pravi gotova epizoda. Isto pojačanje ide na svaku\ntraku, pa se omjer među govornicima čuva.\n\"Preuzmi iz izvornih datoteka\" ne prilagođava baš ništa: auphonic.com i dalje\nradi ono što kaže njegova predefinirana postavka, a bez auphonic.com zvuk\nostaje kakav je u izvornim datotekama."

msgid "    Loudness was not adjusted -- the target below is only what the meter\n    measures against."
msgstr "    Glasnoća nije prilagođena -- cilj u nastavku samo je ono prema čemu\n    mjeri mjerač."

msgid "Who speaks when"
msgstr "Ko kada govori"

msgid "Writing the camera files"
msgstr "Zapisivanje datoteka kamera"

msgid "Handover and result"
msgstr "Predaja i rezultat"

msgid "Show twice as much (minus key, or the wheel over the band)"
msgstr "Prikaži dvostruko više (tipka minus, ili kotačić iznad pojasa)"

msgid "Show half as much, around the current position (plus key, or the wheel over the band)"
msgstr "Prikaži upola manje, oko trenutnog položaja (tipka plus, ili kotačić iznad pojasa)"

msgid "The whole length again (0 key)"
msgstr "Ponovo cijela dužina (tipka 0)"

msgid "  Also fetched: %s"
msgstr "  Također dohvaćeno: %s"

msgid "Auphonic will not take the settings: %s"
msgstr "Auphonic ne prihvata postavke: %s"

msgid "      %s channels"
msgstr "      kanala: %s"

msgid "measurement running ..."
msgstr "mjerenje u toku ..."

msgid "      Channel %d"
msgstr "      Kanal %d"

msgid "Looking at the channels"
msgstr "Pregled kanala"

msgid "channels not readable: %s"
msgstr "kanali nisu čitljivi: %s"

msgid "unused input -- ignored"
msgstr "neiskorišten ulaz -- zanemaren"

msgid "uncertain -- %s"
msgstr "nesigurno -- %s"

msgid "set by hand -- overrides the measurement"
msgstr "postavljeno ručno -- ima prednost pred mjerenjem"

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Jezik"

msgid "both channels identical -- mono laid on both sides"
msgstr "oba kanala jednaka -- mono položen na obje strane"

msgid "probably two microphones -- about %s m apart%s"
msgstr "vjerovatno dva mikrofona -- oko %s m razmaka%s"

msgid ", agreed at %s of %s places"
msgstr ", slaganje na %s od %s mjesta"

msgid "probably one stereo track -- both microphones in the same place"
msgstr "vjerovatno jedna stereo traka -- oba mikrofona na istom mjestu"

msgid "not recognisable -- only %s of %s places where both channels carry sound, %s needed"
msgstr "nije prepoznatljivo -- samo %s od %s mjesta gdje oba kanala nose zvuk, potrebno %s"

msgid "not recognisable -- these two agree no better than each does with the channel beside it"
msgstr "nije prepoznatljivo -- ova dva se ne slažu ništa bolje nego svaki od njih s kanalom pored sebe"

msgid "not set"
msgstr "nije postavljeno"

msgid "The language spoken in the recording. It becomes the tag of the\nwritten audio track, and the recognition here is told to expect it.\nPreset from the system language. \"%s\" leaves the track untagged\nand lets the recognition work the language out itself."
msgstr "Jezik kojim se govori u snimku. Postaje oznaka\nzapisane audio trake, a ovdašnjem prepoznavanju se kaže da ga očekuje.\nUnaprijed postavljeno iz jezika sistema. \"%s\" ostavlja traku bez oznake\ni prepušta prepoznavanju da samo odredi jezik."

